---
<section
  id="what"
  data-screen-label="01 Statement"
  style="scroll-margin-top:64px;padding:var(--secpad) var(--gx) var(--secpad) calc(var(--rail) + var(--gx));display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(var(--cols),minmax(0,1fr));column-gap:24px"
>
  <div
    style="grid-column:var(--c-stmt);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:40px"
  >
    <span style="color:var(--acc)">01</span> — What I do
  </div>
  <p
    id="stmt-text"
    style="grid-column:var(--c-stmt);margin:0;font-family:'Instrument Serif',serif;font-size:var(--stmt);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.02em;text-wrap:pretty"
  >
    <span data-w="">I</span> <span data-w="">build</span> <span data-w="">fast</span> <span data-w="">websites</span> <span data-w="">and</span> <span data-w="">web</span> <span data-w="">apps</span> <span data-w="">for</span> <span data-w="" style="font-style:italic">startups,</span> <span data-w="" style="font-style:italic">growing</span> <span data-w="" style="font-style:italic">brands</span> <span data-w="">and</span> <span data-w="" style="font-style:italic">local</span> <span data-w="" style="font-style:italic">favourites</span> <span data-w="">—</span> <span data-w="">easy</span> <span data-w="">to</span> <span data-w="">find</span> <span data-w="">on</span> <span data-w="">Google,</span> <span data-w="">quick</span> <span data-w="">on</span> <span data-w="">any</span> <span data-w="">phone,</span> <span data-w="">and</span> <span data-w="">built</span> <span data-w="">to</span> <span data-w="">turn</span> <span data-w="">visitors</span> <span data-w="">into</span> <span data-w="" style="font-style:italic;color:var(--acc)">customers.</span>
  </p>
  <div style="grid-column:var(--c-stmt);display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:56px">
    <a
      href="#work"
      style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;border-bottom:1px solid currentColor;padding-bottom:4px"
    >
      → See the work
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

